    {
      "tr": "`int(np.isnan(arr).sum())` ve `round(float(np.nanmean(arr)), 2)`.",
      "en": "`int(np.isnan(arr).sum())` and `round(float(np.nanmean(arr)), 2)`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\nimport numpy as np\n\n\ndef missing_and_mean(values):\n    arr = np.array(values, dtype=float)\n    missing = int(np.isnan(arr).sum())\n    return [missing, round(float(np.nanmean(arr)), 2)]\n\nprint(missing_and_mean([3, None, 5]))\nprint(missing_and_mean([1, 2, 3]))\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\nimport numpy as np\n\n\ndef missing_and_mean(values):\n    arr = np.array(values, dtype=float)\n    missing = int(np.isnan(arr).sum())\n    return [missing, round(float(np.nanmean(arr)), 2)]\n\nprint(missing_and_mean([3, None, 5]))\nprint(missing_and_mean([1, 2, 3]))\n```"
    }
  ],
